@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Postal Address API
	Testing Koroneiki Postal Address API functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Engr Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Automotive      |
	| Koroneiki Engineering     |

Scenario: Create and view postal address
	Koroneiki postal addresses created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a postal address for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Type                  | Business        |
	| Mailing               | True            |
	| Postal Code           | 91761           |
	| Primary               | True            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 123 Fake Street |
	Then I should be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "123 Fake Street" with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Type                  | Business        |
	| Mailing               | True            |
	| Postal Code           | 91761           |
	| Primary               | True            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 123 Fake Street |

Scenario: Create and view postal address with no region
	Koroneiki postal addresses with no region created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | Japan                                    | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a postal address for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Country               | Japan          |
	| Locality              | Chuo-ku, Tokyo |
	| Type                  | Business       |
	| Mailing               | True           |
	| Postal Code           | 91761          |
	| Primary               | True           |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 5 2 1 Ginza    |
	Then I should be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "5 2 1 Ginza" with the following values
	| Country               | Japan          |
	| Locality              | Chuo-ku, Tokyo |
	| Type                  | Business       |
	| Mailing               | True           |
	| Postal Code           | 91761          |
	| Primary               | True           |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 5 2 1 Ginza    |

Scenario: Create and view multiple postal addresses
	Multiple postal addresses created via API should be viewable via API.

